{"4622830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Darkstone Bay", "steam_appid": 4622830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A shipwreck has been hidden on this island for 300 years. Will you be the one to find it?</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the spring of 1721, the Spanish galleon El Diablo Dormido - The Sleeping Devil, vanished from all imperial records without explanation. No wreckage was ever found. No survivors ever surfaced. For three centuries historians assumed the ship was lost to a storm somewhere in the Atlantic. They were wrong. It never left the island. And neither did its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkstone Bay is a first person 3d escape room inspired puzzle adventure. Solve ancient puzzles, decode forgotten symbols, find hidden objects and explore a mysterious uncharted island as you uncover the  secrets of a galleon that vanished in 1721.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross the island, from sandy beaches to ancient caves, old mines and dense jungle. Every location has hidden objects and puzzles to discover on the way. Will you find the galleon and discover what was hidden?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles inspired by escape rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore beautiful environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decode ancient symbols and uncover hidden objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive original soundtrack and effects to pull you into the adventure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: WASD + Mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate: R</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run: SHIFT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu: ESC or M</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A shipwreck has been hidden on this island for 300 years. Will you be the one to find it?</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the spring of 1721, the Spanish galleon El Diablo Dormido - The Sleeping Devil, vanished from all imperial records without explanation. No wreckage was ever found. No survivors ever surfaced. For three centuries historians assumed the ship was lost to a storm somewhere in the Atlantic. They were wrong. It never left the island. And neither did its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkstone Bay is a first person 3d escape room inspired puzzle adventure. Solve ancient puzzles, decode forgotten symbols, find hidden objects and explore a mysterious uncharted island as you uncover the  secrets of a galleon that vanished in 1721.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross the island, from sandy beaches to ancient caves, old mines and dense jungle. Every location has hidden objects and puzzles to discover on the way. Will you find the galleon and discover what was hidden?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles inspired by escape rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore beautiful environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decode ancient symbols and uncover hidden objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive original soundtrack and effects to pull you into the adventure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: WASD + Mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate: R</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run: SHIFT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu: ESC or M</p>", "short_description": "A shipwreck has been hidden on this island for 300 ye